==History==
2022
*The Barbarian Launcher [[Cards|card]] was made available in the [[Tournament|Barbarian Launcher Challenge]] on 1/8/2022.
*On 6/8/2022, the Barbarian Launcher was removed from the game.
*On 10/10/2022, the Barbarian Launcher was readded to the game in the Mega Deck Challenge.
*On 17/10/2022, the Barbarian Launcher was removed from the game.
2024
*On 19/8/2024, the Barbarian Launcher was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 26/8/2024, the Barbarian Launcher was removed from the game.
2025
*On 27/1/2025, the Barbarian Launcher was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 3/2/2025, the Barbarian Launcher was removed from the game.

